{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Work with a decision"},"description":"\uacb0\uc815\uc744 \ub300\uc2e0 \ub0b4\ub9ac\uc9c0 \uc54a\uace0, \uadf8 \uacb0\uc815\uc774 \uc5b4\ub5a4 \uc804\uc81c \uc704\uc5d0 \uc11c \uc788\ub294\uc9c0\uc640 \uc544\uc9c1 \uc5f4\ub9b0 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc744 \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uc758 \ub9d0 \uadf8\ub300\ub85c \ud3ec\ucc29\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uae30\ub85d\ub41c \uacb0\uc815\uc758 \uc804\uc81c\u00b7\ud604\uc7ac \uc0ac\uc2e4\u00b7\uc608\uce21 \ubb38\uc7a5\u00b7\uc0c1\ud0dc\ub3c4 \uad00\ub9ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nCapture a decision and its user-stated context without deciding for the user. Preserve at most one load-bearing assumption; tag an AI-drafted premise as ai_surfaced. A decision the user has closed or told you not to revisit is never capture material \u2014 acknowledge it and move on; recording it re-opens it.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"action":{"description":"\uc218\ud589\ud560 \uc138\ubd80 \uc791\uc5c5\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nThe operation to perform.","enum":["open","add_context","amend_context","answer_question","keep_question_open","update_fact","change_prediction","plan","plan_check","close"],"type":"string"},"adopted_quote":{"description":"\uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \ub3d9\uc758\ud55c \ub9d0 \uadf8\ub300\ub85c. \uc5c6\uc73c\uba74 \ucc44\ud0dd\uc774 \uc544\ub2d9\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nThe user's adopting words, verbatim.","maxLength":400,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"already_decided":{"type":"boolean"},"amendment":{"description":"amend_context\uc5d0\uc11c \uc804\uc81c\ub97c \uace0\uce58\ub294 \ubc29\uc2dd\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nHow to amend a premise for action=amend_context.","enum":["accept","refine","replace","retire"],"type":"string"},"apply_to_matching":{"type":"boolean"},"argus_dir":{"type":"string"},"changed":{"type":"boolean"},"check_by":{"description":"\uc608\uce21\uc744 \ud604\uc2e4\uacfc \ub300\uc870\ud560 \ubbf8\ub798 \ud655\uc778\uc77c(YYYY-MM-DD)\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nFuture date, in YYYY-MM-DD, when the prediction can be checked.","pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"decision":{"maxLength":600,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"dismiss_reason":{"enum":["became_irrelevant","decided_elsewhere","superseded","user_declined","changed_mind","other"],"type":"string"},"external":{"type":"boolean"},"finding":{"maxLength":800,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"id":{"description":"\uacb0\uc815 \uc2dd\ubcc4\uc790\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nStable identifier for the decision.","maxLength":128,"minLength":1,"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._-]+$","type":"string"},"load_bearing":{"type":"boolean"},"load_bearing_assumption":{"maxLength":400,"type":"string"},"monitoring_enabled":{"type":"boolean"},"note":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"numeric_value":{"type":"number"},"open_questions":{"description":"\uc544\uc9c1 \ubab0\ub77c \ub2e8\uacc4\ub85c \ubabb \ub9cc\ub4e0 \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4 (\"\ud655\uc778 \ud544\uc694: X\").\n\nUnknowns, named instead of invented.","items":{"maxLength":200,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":5,"type":"array"},"plan_owner":{"enum":["user","ai_surfaced"],"type":"string"},"predicate":{"description":"\ud604\uc2e4\uc774 \ucc38/\uac70\uc9d3\uc73c\ub85c \ud655\uc778\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub294 \uc608\uce21\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nA falsifiable prediction that reality can answer.","maxLength":500,"minLength":8,"type":"string"},"premises":{"description":"\ucd94\uac00\ud560 \uc804\uc81c \ub610\ub294 \ubbf8\uacb0 \uc9c8\ubb38 \ubaa9\ub85d\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nPremises or open questions to add.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ai_original":{"description":"source=ai_surfaced\uc774\uba74 \ud544\uc218: AI\uac00 \ucc98\uc74c \uc81c\uc2dc\ud55c \uc815\ud655\ud55c \uc6d0\ubb38. Required with ai_surfaced.","maxLength":400,"type":"string"},"anchor_quote":{"maxLength":400,"minLength":3,"type":"string"},"chat_confirmed":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"confidence":{"description":"\uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \uc2e4\uc81c\ub85c \ud45c\ud604\ud55c \ud655\uc2e0 \uc815\ub3c4\ub9cc. \ucd94\uce21 \uae08\uc9c0, \uc815\uc0b0 \ub54c \ud604\uc2e4\uacfc \ub300\uc870\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nOnly confidence the user expressed; never guess.","enum":["confident","uncertain","contested"],"type":"string"},"external":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"if_false_changes":{"maxLength":400,"type":"string"},"kind":{"default":"premise","enum":["premise","open_question"],"type":"string"},"load_bearing":{"default":false,"type":"boolean"},"monitoring_enabled":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"recheck_cadence_days":{"maximum":365,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"reconsider_cadence_days":{"maximum":365,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"source":{"description":"\uc804\uc81c \ubb38\uc7a5\uc758 \uc791\uc131\uc790: user_stated=\uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790 \uc6d0\ubb38, ai_surfaced=AI \ucd08\uc548(\uc774\ub54c ai_original \ud544\uc218). Premise authorship.","enum":["user_stated","ai_surfaced"],"type":"string"},"text":{"description":"\ud544\uc218: \uae30\ub85d\ud560 \uc804\uc81c \ub610\ub294 \ubbf8\uacb0 \uc9c8\ubb38\uc758 \uc6d0\ubb38\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \ub2eb\uc740 \uacb0\uc815(\"\uc5b4\uc81c \ud655\uc815\ud588\uc5b4\", \"\uc7ac\ub860 \ubd88\uc694\")\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \uc804\uc81c\ub97c \ub9cc\ub4e4\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc804\uc81c\ub294 \uc544\uc9c1 \uc5f4\ub824 \uc788\ub294 \ud310\ub2e8\uc744 \uc704\ud55c \uac83\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\nRequired premise/open-question text. Never build a premise from a decision the user closed (\"we decided yesterday\", \"no need to revisit\"); premises serve judgments that are still open.","maxLength":400,"minLength":3,"type":"string"}},"required":["text","source"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":5,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"question":{"description":"action=open: \uc774 \uacb0\uc815\uc774 \ub2f5\ud558\ub294 \uc9c8\ubb38(\uc120\ud0dd\uc774 \uc544\ub2c8\ub77c \uc9c8\ubb38). \ub3cc\uc544\ubcfc \ub54c \uc120\ud0d